{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# AP Study 全体像\n\n左から右へ: 利用者 → 配信 → アプリ → 保存 → 任意の外部連携","x":-620,"y":-460,"width":600,"height":120,"color":"6"},

		{"id":"user","type":"text","text":"## 👤 学習者\n\nスマホ / PC のブラウザ\nオフラインでも学習できる","x":-620,"y":-260,"width":260,"height":140,"color":"5"},

		{"id":"deliver","type":"text","text":"## 🌐 配信(2系統)\n\n**GitHub Pages**\nmain へ push で自動\n\n**AWS S3 + CloudFront**\n手動デプロイのみ ⚠️","x":-300,"y":-280,"width":280,"height":180,"color":"2"},

		{"id":"app","type":"text","text":"## ⚛️ SPA\n\nReact + Vite + TypeScript\nHashRouter\n\n問題データ(880問)を\nバンドルに同梱","x":40,"y":-280,"width":260,"height":180,"color":"4"},

		{"id":"store","type":"text","text":"## 💾 localStorage\n\n`ap-study:v1` 学習データ\n`ap-study:ai` APIキー(隔離)\n`ap-study:mock` 模試の中断\n`ap-run:*` 演習の中断","x":380,"y":-300,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"3"},

		{"id":"sync","type":"text","text":"## 🔀 同期API(任意)\n\nLambda + DynamoDB\npull → merge → push\n\nマージはクライアント側","x":380,"y":-40,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"1"},

		{"id":"ai","type":"text","text":"## ✨ AI(任意)\n\nCodexブリッジ(ローカル)\nOpenAI / Anthropic / xAI\n\n未設定でも学習機能は全て動く","x":40,"y":-40,"width":260,"height":160,"color":"1"},

		{"id":"modes","type":"text","text":"## 🎯 学習モード\n\n- 分野別演習 `practice`\n- 反復学習 `drill`\n- 復習 `review`\n- 模試 `mock`\n- ことばドリル\n- 午後演習(自己採点)","x":-300,"y":-40,"width":280,"height":200,"color":"4"},

		{"id":"derive","type":"text","text":"## 🧮 導出\n\n**attempts が真実の源**\n\n分析 / 実績 / ことば帳 /\n復習キューの修復\nすべてここから再計算できる","x":40,"y":180,"width":260,"height":180,"color":"3"},

		{"id":"staticdata","type":"text","text":"## 📚 静的データ\n\n午前 11回 880問\n午後 8回 40問\n用語カード 320語\n図表 70枚超","x":-300,"y":200,"width":280,"height":160,"color":"2"},

		{"id":"docs","type":"file","file":"ホーム.md","x":-620,"y":-40,"width":260,"height":140},
